+ * top and bottom bar of every buffer with opaque black under a full-screen
+ * scissor, so the shared lines hold exactly the pixels they would hold
+ * unaliased. The buffers are still each 320x240 with a 320-word linestride, so
+ * the RDP/VI see an ordinary framebuffer.
